# 📖 TOEIC Grammar - Day37

## Topic
# 접속사 vs 전치사
### Conjunction vs Preposition

---

## 1. 가장 중요한 차이

접속사 뒤에는

### 주어 + 동사

가 올 수 있다.

전치사 뒤에는

### 명사 / 동명사

가 온다.

---

## 2. because vs because of

### because + 주어 + 동사

The meeting was canceled **because it was raining**.

→ 비가 오고 있었기 때문에 회의가 취소되었다.

### because of + 명사

The meeting was canceled **because of the rain**.

→ 비 때문에 회의가 취소되었다.

---

## 3. although vs despite

### although + 주어 + 동사

**Although it was raining**, we went outside.

### despite + 명사 / 동명사

**Despite the rain**, we went outside.

**Despite being tired**, he continued working.

---

## 4. while vs during

### while + 주어 + 동사

I listened to music **while I was studying**.

### during + 명사

I listened to music **during the study session**.

---

## 5. 접속사

다음은 뒤에 주어 + 동사가 올 수 있다.

because
although
while
if
when
unless
before
after

### Example

I stayed home **because I was tired**.

Call me **when you arrive**.

We will go outside **if the weather improves**.

---

## 6. 전치사

다음은 뒤에 명사 또는 동명사가 온다.

because of
despite
during
without
before
after
instead of

### Example

We stayed home **because of the rain**.

He left **without saying goodbye**.

She studied **instead of watching TV**.

---

## 7. TOEIC 함정

### because + 명사 ❌

because the rain → ❌

because **it rained** → ⭕

### because of + 명사 ⭕

because of **the rain** → ⭕

---

### although + 명사 ❌

although the rain → ❌

although **it was raining** → ⭕

### despite + 명사 ⭕

despite **the rain** → ⭕

---

## 8. Before / After 주의

before와 after는
접속사와 전치사 모두 가능하다.

### 접속사

before I left

after I arrived

### 전치사

before the meeting

after lunch

---

## Quick Test

_____ the heavy rain, the event continued as planned.

A. Although
B. Because
C. Despite
D. While

Answer: C

→ the heavy rain = 명사
→ despite + 명사
